// Warehouse: 40 × 24 m, 8 m to the eaves. A concrete-block base (to 2.4 m) carries corrugated
// cladding; three loading bays face the yard (one with a jammed roller door you can crawl under);
// an L-shaped mezzanine runs along the north and west walls at 4 m, and much of the roof has fallen in.
// Wall segments of both outline runs: 0 north (x 0→40), 1 east (z 0→24), 2 south (x 40→0,
// at_m = 40 − x), 3 west (z 24→0, at_m = 24 − z).
